ts and partitions</span><br></span><span class=3D"token-line" style=3D"colo=
r: rgb(191, 199, 213);"><span class=3D"token plain">salloc -A account -p ck=
pt-all -N 1 -c 4 --mem=3D10G --time=3D2:30:00</span><br></span></code></pre=
