<p>In this case you are requesting a slice of the standard compute node cla=
ss that your group <code>mylab</code> contributed to the cluster. You are a=
sking for 4 compute cores with 10GB of memory for 2 hours and 30 minutes sp=
read across 1 node (single machine). The <code>salloc</code> command will a=
utomatically create an interactive shell session on an allocated node.</p>
